<text x="600" y="80" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Arial,Microsoft YaHei" font-size="16" fill="#5e6c84">Vs = 12 V，R1 = 1 kΩ，R2 = 2 kΩ，RL = 3 kΩ，端口 a-b</text>
